  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Strategic International Positioning</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Posicionamiento Estratgico Internacional</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El programa tiene como objetivo general contribuir a la consolidacin del posicionamiento internacional de Uruguay mediante el fortalecimiento del marco normativo e institucional para la atraccin de inversiones, la promocin y facilitacin comercial, y la maximizacin del impacto local de dicho posicionamiento. Los objetivos especficos del programa son: i) impulsar la atraccin de inversiones orientadas a sectores de alto valor agregado; ii) mejorar los estndares de promocin y facilitacin comercial; y iii) mejorar el desarrollo de las capacidades locales de innovacin y absorcin tecnolgica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen the international position of Uruguay through improved policy and institutional framework for attracting investment, promotion and trade facilitation, and maximizing the associated local impact. The specific The program&apos;s general objective is to contribute to strengthening the international position of Uruguay by strengthening the regulatory and institutional framework to attract investment, promotion and trade facilitation, and maximizing the local impact of this positioning. The specific objectives are: i) promote investments aimed at attracting high value-added sectors, ii) improve the standards of promotion and trade facilitation, and iii) enhance the development of local capacity for innovation and technology absorption.</narrative>
  </description>
